WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.770
In Ukraine tonight, brutal fighting

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.672
along the front lines as Kiev's

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.640
counteroffensive grinds out.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.308
Hard fought

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.043
gains against heavily fortified

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.178
Russian positions in Ukraine.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.246
Russian airstrikes

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.381
and artillery attacks

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:14.814
are going

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.116
on, reportedly

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.018
slowing the Ukrainian advance,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.486
at least for now.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.154
Our senior international correspondent

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.622
Fred Pleitgen is joining us

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.624
with all the latest from the war zone.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.827
Ukraine's army continuing

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.329
to take the fight to the Russians

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.630
on the southern front.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.632
This video shows the 128th

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.800
territorial defense

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.001
battalion clearing

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.569
trenches after ousting

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.004
Vladimir Putin's army.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.539
The unit says

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.941
one of the soldiers nicknamed the octopus

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.177
telling me the fighting remains fierce.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:45.378
Adjust. They just.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.414
We're currently launching an assault,

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:47.881
he says.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.716
Our front line is moving forward.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.683
We've already advanced

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.318
a lot more than two kilometers.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.421
So now we're only moving forward.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.724
Even after returning from the

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:58.291
front line,

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.993
the troops continue to train,

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.795
assaulting enemy positions.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:02.996
So important

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:03.663
for Ukraine's

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.799
ongoing major counter offensive.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.534
The guys here say that the battles

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.468
that they've had with the Russians

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:09.769
have been extremely tough.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.237
They've had to fight for every yard,

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.839
and yet they are confident,

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:13.940
they say, that they can make

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.242
this counteroffensive a success.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:16.543
Troops

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.410
we spoke to say

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.912
the biggest threat to them is

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.013
Russian air power.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:20.847
I'd like

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:21.714
this video

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.583
released by the Russian defense ministry

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.652
purporting to show a Russian attack

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:26.486
helicopter

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.521
hitting a Ukrainian armored vehicle.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.791
The 128th deputy commander acknowledges

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:32.859
choppers, planes

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:34.694
and drones are making his forces

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.062
advance tougher.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.597
Was put out too late then,

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.299
so they work continuously,

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.600
he says, all day long,

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.869
either with helicopters or with planes.

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:44.671
It's hard to advance like that,

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.239
but we retake territory.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.308
We do not allow them to hit the columns.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:50.410
And the unit says

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.411
they've managed to capture

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.745
not only territory,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.747
but also hardware from the Russians,

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.950
including this infantry fighting vehicle.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:58.818
Mechanics now

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.187
fixing it up to use against the Russians.

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:04.224
An angry Russian president

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:05.492
complaining about Kiev's

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.559
offensive and claiming

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.194
that Russia is beating back

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:11.197
Ukraine's forces, but

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:12.665
they've suffered large losses.

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:13.666
Vladimir Putin says

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.568
ten times more than the Russian army.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.704
And that is a fact

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:19.105
The Ukrainians do

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.373
acknowledge some losses,

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.875
but also say they've taken out

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.576
a lot of Russian assets

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:24.210
and these troops

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.411
vow to press on

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.779
and take more vehicles

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.848
from Moscow's troops as they advance

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:32.118
So as you can see

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:33.186
there, Wolf, some serious

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.721
fighting going on on the southern

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:35.321
front line.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:35.989
I have to say, though,

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.624
the forces that we spoke to today,

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.525
they were pretty upbeat

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:40.260
about the situation, upbeat.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.328
The Ukrainians also about the situation

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:43.396
in the east of the country.

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:43.696
In fact,

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:44.564
they're saying that they're making

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.665
some pretty big gains

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.100
around the area of Bermuda.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.735
They also say that the Russians are now

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.737
bringing some combat ready

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:52.472
forces into that area as well

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.240
to try and hold the Ukrainians up.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.842
But the Ukrainians are saying

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:57.744
they are making some real gains around

00:02:57.744 --> 00:02:58.678
Bermuda Wolf.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:02:59.512
All right, Fred Pleitgen,

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:00.246
as Operation

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:01.514
in the war zone in Ukraine for us,

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:01.981
thank you.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.982
Stay safe.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.551
Oksana Merkava,

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:05.084
ambassador,

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.519
thank you so much for joining us.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:07.754
How do you respond

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:09.222
to those nuclear threats

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.390
that we're hearing now?

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.025
Directly from Vladimir Putin?

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:17.430
Wolf, and thank you for having me.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.599
Well, we have to just remind ourselves

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.134
that it is Ukraine

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.703
that got rid of a third nuclear

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.705
arsenal in 1994.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:26.839
It is Ukraine

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.141
that was always peaceful

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.375
and it's Russia

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.778
that continuously is a threat of risk.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.681
Not only military in Ukraine

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.548
and in the region,

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:37.817
but food security, energy security.

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.219
And at this point,

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:41.354
you know, again, as we said before,

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:44.057
we should remind an indicted

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.024
war criminal, Mr.

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:47.260
Putin, that instead of continuing

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:49.562
threaten and peaceful nations,

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.997
he should focus on actually

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:51.698
getting out

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:52.432
from Ukraine

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:54.300
where his troops performed

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.735
miserably and quit

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.938
when we conducted a number of war crimes,

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:01.107
including the massive shelling of Kiev

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:02.642
and problems today.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:05.245
So on blowing up the Hoover Dam

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.646
and all the atrocities

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:07.647
that they have committed.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:08.414
So yes,

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:10.550
it's it's another it's

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:13.519
to threaten all of us so that we stop

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:15.121
in defending democracy,

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:17.890
freedom and the values that we all share.

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:19.492
And we will not stop.

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:21.594
We will continue to liberate in Ukraine.

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:22.795
And I am positive

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:25.098
our friends will also not stop

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.432
in supporting Ukraine

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.100
as Ukraine

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.034
ambassador makes

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:29.035
what are being described

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.037
as incremental advances

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:32.639
in this new counteroffensive.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:34.774
What would you say to some Western allies

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.843
waiting to see what they want to see,

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:38.878
namely major gains out there

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:39.912
on the battlefield?

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:42.682
We all knew

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:43.283
it's good

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:46.152
is that it's going to be very difficult.

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:49.289
You know, we the front

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:51.991
is very low on South

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.594
East of Ukraine.

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:55.295
Plus, again,

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:56.763
the fact that Russians blew up

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:57.964
the dam and flooded

00:04:57.964 --> 00:04:58.831
the whole area

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:01.200
and saw not only devastation

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:04.537
dozens of villages and affected people,

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:08.007
but also making it difficult.

00:05:08.007 --> 00:05:09.642
You know, but again,

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.511
regardless of how hard it is,

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.279
we have heard President Zelensky

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:14.180
loud and clear

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.782
and all the commanders,

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.717
we are making progress.

00:05:17.717 --> 00:05:19.786
We will make progress.

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:20.320
Of course,

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:20.887
all of us

00:05:20.887 --> 00:05:21.421
would like it

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.189
to be as fast as possible

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:24.357
because it's our people

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:26.459
who are suffering under occupation there.

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:28.828
And we have very high trust

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:29.729
in our commanders

00:05:29.729 --> 00:05:31.264
and our brave defenders.

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.199
Regardless of how hard it is.

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.335
We will liberate all Ukraine.

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:37.203
Ambassador, CNN has learned

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:37.970
and I assume you know

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.272
this, that President Biden

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:40.106
is now willing

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:43.009
to drop one hurdle in Ukraine's push

00:05:43.242 --> 00:05:45.211
to become a NATO member.

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.012
Is that small

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:47.914
step enough to deter Russia?

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:48.514
What do you think

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.820
I will only say that,

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.587
you know, Ukraine

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:57.156
has made our civilisational choice.

00:05:57.623 --> 00:05:59.058
We would like to be a member

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.226
of the European Union,

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:02.228
and we're already candidate country

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:04.497
and we would like to be a member of NATO.

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:05.665
It's in our hearts.

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:07.266
It's in our Constitution.

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:09.302
It's something that not only the majority

00:06:09.302 --> 00:06:11.371
of Ukrainians share and believe in,

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.272
but also it's

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:15.074
we believe that Ukraine has a lot

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:16.743
to add to later.

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:19.512
Now, how it will happen, it's for us

00:06:19.512 --> 00:06:22.014
and all the NATO members to decide.

00:06:22.014 --> 00:06:22.982
But I think, you know,

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:25.284
not only that Ukraine is ready

00:06:25.485 --> 00:06:27.653
and willing to be part of

00:06:29.155 --> 00:06:30.256
this family

00:06:30.256 --> 00:06:31.824
of civilized countries, countries

00:06:31.824 --> 00:06:33.993
that share the same values,

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:37.263
but we have done a lot of reforms and

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.432
have a lot to end But,

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.566
you know, again, as we all are

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:42.135
preparing for the summit,

00:06:42.135 --> 00:06:44.404
of course, we will not go ahead and say,

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:46.739
you know,

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.175
the expectations, but we work a lot

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:50.877
with our friends and partners

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:53.045
and we really believe in that.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.848
Ambassador Oksana Makarova.

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:57.517
Good luck to you, as I always tell you.

00:06:57.517 --> 00:06:58.050
And good luck

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.085
to all the people of Ukraine.

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:00.386
Thanks so much for joining us.

